extends ../../layouts/master.pug

block title
  title NBC - Give

block header
  include ../../components/header.pug

block content
  section.section-box
    .banner-hero.bg-service-2
      .container
        .row
          .col-lg-12.text-center
            h1.text-display-2
              | Giving Opportunities
            .mt-40.text-center
              a.btn.btn-black.icon-arrow-right-white(href='page-about-1.html') Get Started
              a.btn.btn-link.icon-triangle.color-gray-900.ml-40(href='page-faqs-2.html') How it works

  section.section-box.mt-90
    .container
      .row
        .col-lg-2.col-sm-1.col-12
        .col-lg-8.col-sm-10.col-12.text-center.mt-40
          h2.text-heading-1.color-gray-900.mb-10
            | Why should you give?
          p.text-body-lead-large.color-gray-600.mt-20
            | Here are two reasons, among many others.
        .col-lg-2.col-sm-1.col-12
    .container.mt-90.mb-100
      .row
        .col-lg-6.col-sm-12
          .bg-2.box-square.hover-up
            h4.text-heading-4.color-gray-900.mb-15 Affordable Education
            p.text-body-text-md.color-gray-600
              | Tuition at NBC is lower per semester hour than it is in many other private colleges or universities because of giving by individuals and by the Church of the Nazarene. This includes the Annual Offering. In reality, the actual cost of Christian education at NBC is significantly higher than the tuition charge to the student. Your giving helps make up that difference.
            .box-image-inner.bg-color-1
              img(src='/assets/imgs/stock/AdobeStock_286503364.jpeg', alt='Smiling man touching the brim of his hat')
        .col-lg-6.col-sm-12
          .bg-6.box-square.hover-up
            h4.text-heading-4.color-gray-900.mb-15 State-of-the-Art Technology
            p.text-body-text-md.color-gray-600.mb-65
              | Students need state-of-the-art technology to help them stay competitive in today’s job market. Your giving helps provide the equipment, platforms and facilities they need.
            .box-image-inner.bg-color-2
              img(src='/assets/imgs/stock/AdobeStock_233516145.jpeg', alt='Man working on a laptop')

  .container
    .row.mt-100
      .col-lg-6.col-sm-12.col-12
        ul.list-icons-give
          li
            h3.text-heading-5.mb-10 How much should you give?
            p.text-body-text.color-gray-500
              | All gifts help greatly. Your gift of any size is both appreciated and tremendously beneficial. While NBC does need the large donations some churches are able to give, total participation of all individuals and churches is very valuable.
          li
            h3.text-heading-5.mb-10 Who do you contact for more detailed information about giving?
            p.text-body-text.color-gray-500
              | Contact the Vice President for Development at 800-873-3873, ext. 5091.
      .col-lg-6.col-sm-12.col-12
        ul.list-icons-give
          li
            h3.text-heading-5.mb-10 Are there tax benefits for giving?
            p.text-body-text.color-gray-500
              | There are tax benefits for most donations given by individuals or corporations. The manner by which the donation is given will determine the benefit. Nazarene Bible College is a non-profit corporation. All cash donations qualify for a tax deduction on the IRS Form 1040. The manner in which gifts are given — charitable donations, trusts, bequests, personal or real property, stock, etc. — determine the tax benefits. NBC does not employ a specific tax advisor but encourages you to contact the Nazarene Foundation office or your accountant with any questions you have.

  section.section-box.mt-30
    .container
      .row
        .col-lg-12.col-sm-10.col-12.text-center.mt-40
          h2.text-heading-1.color-gray-900.mb-10 Giving with a Purpose
    .container.mt-30
      .row
        .col-lg-4.col-md-12.col-sm-12
          .list-icons.mt-50
            .item-icon.none-bd
              span.icon-left
                img(src='/assets/imgs/page/homepage2/icon-acquis.svg', alt='Agon')
              h4.text-heading-4 1. Annual Offering
              p.text-body-text.color-gray-600.mt-15
                | Give to the Annual Offering through your local Nazarene Church.
        .col-lg-4.col-md-12.col-sm-12
          .list-icons.mt-50
            .item-icon.none-bd
              span.icon-left
                img(src='/assets/imgs/page/homepage2/icon-active.svg', alt='Agon')
              h4.text-heading-4 2. Scholarships
              p.text-body-text.color-gray-600.mt-15
                | Contact the Vice President for Development at 800-873-3873, ext. 5091, for more information about establishing or giving to specific scholarships.
        .col-lg-4.col-md-12.col-sm-12
          .list-icons.mt-50
            .item-icon.none-bd
              span.icon-left
                img(src='/assets/imgs/page/homepage2/icon-retent.svg', alt='Agon')
              h4.text-heading-4 3. The Samaritan Fund
              p.text-body-text.color-gray-600.mt-15
                | Give to assist campus students and their families in emergencies. Contact the Vice President for Church Relations and Student Success at [CONTACT INFO HERE] for more information about giving to this fund.
        .col-lg-4.col-md-12.col-sm-12
          .list-icons.mt-50
            .item-icon.none-bd
              span.icon-left
                img(src='/assets/imgs/page/homepage2/icon-acquis.svg', alt='Agon')
              h4.text-heading-4 4. Lyle Potter Loan Fund
              p.text-body-text.color-gray-600.mt-15
                | Give to this emergency loan fund and assist campus students through times of crisis on a short-term basis. Requests for assistance should be submitted to the Vice President for Finance.
        .col-lg-4.col-md-12.col-sm-12
          .list-icons.mt-50
            .item-icon.none-bd
              span.icon-left
                img(src='/assets/imgs/page/homepage2/icon-active.svg', alt='Agon')
              h4.text-heading-4 5. Endowed Chair
              p.text-body-text.color-gray-600.mt-15
                | Give to establish a "Chair" in a specific area of study. This fund is endowed and helps to provide funds for a professor to teach in a particular filed.
        .col-lg-4.col-md-12.col-sm-12
          .list-icons.mt-50
            .item-icon.none-bd
              span.icon-left
                img(src='/assets/imgs/page/homepage2/icon-retent.svg', alt='Agon')
              h4.text-heading-4 6. Other Gifts
              p.text-body-text.color-gray-600.mt-15
                | Individuals may give cash and personal or real property toward the ongoing needs of the college or toward an area of emphasis that is special to him or her.


  include ../../sections/section_newsletter_2.pug